[0.00839, "o", "\u001b[1;34mmonthly-invoicing\u001b[0m \u001b[2m$\u001b[0m agk validate\r\n"]
[1.059641, "o", "user namespace remapping is off on this daemon and this runner does not require it, so the floor is lifted: a task's files are owned by a real uid on the host, root inside a container is the host's own root, and a process that escapes a container is that account rather than an unprivileged high-numbered one that maps to no real user.\r\nthis daemon applies neither an AppArmor profile nor an SELinux label to a container, which is the host's to offer, so a container is held by its namespaces, its dropped capabilities and its seccomp profile with no mandatory access control behind them.\r\n"]
